WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.735
Start on Today and check who's next.

00:00:03.585 --> 00:00:06.819
This is a five-client day, with two visits
already finished.

00:00:08.069 --> 00:00:11.436
When you arrive, tap Check in for the
client you're visiting.

00:00:12.436 --> 00:00:14.535
Check their name before adding a note.

00:00:15.735 --> 00:00:17.826
When the visit is finished, mark it
complete.

00:00:18.976 --> 00:00:22.574
Today moves on to the next client, and the
count goes up to three of five.

00:00:23.874 --> 00:00:27.225
Routes follow your client order, not an
optimised driving route.

00:00:28.075 --> 00:00:31.292
Check addresses and appointment windows
before relying on the plan.

00:00:32.142 --> 00:00:37.265
Changes to clients can update unfinished
visits, but a visit you're checked in to is
protected.
